E-Commerce App (Qt Quick QML)

Overview

This project is a simple E-Commerce application developed using Qt Quick (QML). It demonstrates basic navigation between screens and displays different product categories through a modern user interface.

Features

* Splash Screen
* Automatic navigation after 3 seconds
* Home Screen
* Product Categories:
    * Cars
    * Computers
    * Phones
    * Courses
    * Homes
* Clean and responsive QML interface
* Implemented using QML only (No C++ logic)

Technologies Used

* Qt 6
* Qt Quick
* QML
* JavaScript (inside QML when needed)

Project Structure

* main.qml – Application entry point
* SplashScreen.qml – Splash screen
* HomeScreen.qml – Main home screen
* CategoryCard.qml – Reusable category component
* assets/ – Images and icons

How to Run

1. Open the project using Qt Creator.
2. Configure the Qt Kit.
3. Build the project.
4. Run the application.

Output

The application starts with a splash screen, waits for 3 seconds, then automatically opens the Home Screen where users can browse the available categories.
